BECKET: <i>I told you
this is a tragedy.</i>

1890
01:37:24,554 --> 01:37:26,336
<i>It's not about me, is it?</i>

1891
01:37:27,293 --> 01:37:28,859
<i>I think it's about you,</i>

1892
01:37:28,902 --> 01:37:33,119
<i>with all your values
