<i>And in a perfect universe,</i>

1895
01:37:40,901 --> 01:37:41,901
<i>it would have.</i>

1896
01:37:45,293 --> 01:37:47,206
<i>But someone once told me</i>

1897
01:37:47,249 --> 01:37:49,293
<i>that the only thing
that can hurt us in life</i>

1898
01:37:49,336 --> 01:37:51,597
<i>is the voice
of our own conscience</i>

1899
01:37:51,640 --> 01:37:54,249
<i>telling us a story
about right and wrong.</i>

1900
01:37:56,206 --> 01:37:59,335
<i>If you turn your head
just right into the wind,</i>

1901
01:38:00,684 --> 01:38:03,248
<i>you can make that voice
go down to a whisper.</i>

1902
01:38:05,597 --> 01:38:07,509
<i>And after a while,</i>

1903
01:38:07,553 --> 01:38:10,118
<i>you might never hear it at all.</i>

